OL,13,     FLahav Shani conducts La Scala
OL,14,     FPhilharmonic Orchestra in
OL,15,     FMendelssohn's Violin Concerto in E
OL,16,     Fminor, joined by violinist Joshua
OL,17,     FBell. We then hear Dvorak's
OL,18,     Fintense Symphony No 9.
